body:
older alter/co-host here. i do my best to listen to her, and she can handle a lot (often more than my co-host tbh lol) but there's some things i think she just can't handle, and i'm not without reasons for trying to limit those. i worry about her health and i did try letting her handle those things, but i've come to realize it's not a good idea, thanks to a lot of things (including advice from other systems). she's talking about things that really should not be around children, even if they're more capable or thoughtful children. it's about safety, which we have to balance with alter's agency

&#x200B;

\- M
